{title: Scarborough Fair}
{artist: Traditional (English)}
{license: public-domain}
{tempo: 72}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Am]Are you [G]going to [Am]Scarborough Fair?
[C]Parsley, [Am]sage, [C]rosemary [D]and [Am]thyme
[Am]Remember me to [C]one who [G]lives there
[Am]She once was [G]a true love [Am]of mine
{end_of_verse}
